{
 "note": "The all-time Hapoel Tel Aviv football roster as the Red Fans wiki category lists it, supplied by The Worker team. Names only — no season, position, shirt number or appearance count, because the list carries none and inventing them would be a claim no source makes. These records exist so that every player question draws its distractors from people who actually wore the shirt. A bracketed qualifier (חלוץ / קשר / כדורגלן) is disambiguation between two people of the same name and is kept out of the display alias. Where two players reduce to the same bare name, neither record claims the bare name as an alias — an ambiguous alias is refused by the importer rather than assigned by guesswork. 16 שמות נוספו ב-16.9.2026 מקטגוריית \"כדורגלני הפועל תל אביב\" בוויקיפדיה העברית — ערכים עם מקור שלא היו ברשימת ויקיפועל. הם נוספו בשמם כפי שהערך כותב אותו, בלי לשנות שם קיים.",
